      "message": "feat(2d)!: retire Adaptive strategy from 2D Pocket\n\nDrop Adaptive from 2D Pocket's UI strategy list and refuse Pocket +\nAdaptive by name across operation doors and generation, pointing users\nto 2D Adaptive. Migrate pre-v64 Pocket Adaptive operations on open to\n2D Adaptive (Spiral), bump PROJECT_VERSION to 64, and flag any\ndropped un-carriable fields (rest, predrilled) as needs_review until\nmarked reviewed via MarkOperationReviewed / mark_operation_reviewed.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: project files are written as version 64; older builds refuse them.",
